From 47603aae9839ce9eb3125cc260c66a2d69c752e0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AlexProgrammerDE <40795980+AlexProgrammerDE@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 16:53:01 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat(bedrock): add social, party, and Realm Hub support

Bring the Bedrock social and Realms integration into one upstream feature so its account flows and screens can be reviewed together. Add friend profiles, party chat and invitations, Realm Hub details, achievements, statistics, and the image loading used by those screens.

This adapts the work from viafabricplus-bedrock PR #7. Keep it as one feature patch because the screens share account and social services and should be promoted together.
